---
import ProjectLayout from '../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import MermaidDiagram from '../../components/astro/MermaidDiagram.astro';
import { diagrams } from '../../data/diagrams';
---

<ProjectLayout title="Jenkins CI/CD Pipeline - Mark Lester Perez" projectTitle="Jenkins CI/CD Pipeline">
  <h2>Project Overview</h2>
  <p>
    Implementation of a robust CI/CD pipeline using Jenkins for automating the build,
    test, and deployment of Spring Boot applications to AWS ECS.
  </p>

  <h2>Prerequisites</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Jenkins server with Docker support</li>
    <li>AWS credentials configured in Jenkins</li>
    <li>ECR repository created</li>
    <li>ECS cluster and service configured</li>
    <li>Spring Boot application with Dockerfile</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Pipeline Stages</h2>

  <h3>1. Build Application</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Clone repository</li>
    <li>Build with Maven/Gradle</li>
    <li>Run unit tests</li>
    <li>Generate test reports</li>
    <li>SonarQube code analysis</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>2. Build and Push Docker Image</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Build Docker image</li>
    <li>Scan for vulnerabilities with Trivy</li>
    <li>Login to Amazon ECR</li>
    <li>Tag and push image</li>
    <li>Clean up local images</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>3. Deploy to ECS</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Update task definition</li>
    <li>Deploy new service revision</li>
    <li>Wait for steady state</li>
    <li>Health check verification</li>
    <li>Rollback on failure</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Architecture Diagram</h2>
  <MermaidDiagram diagram={diagrams.jenkins} />

  <h2>Pipeline Monitoring</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Build status notifications</li>
    <li>Deployment metrics tracking</li>
    <li>Test coverage reports</li>
    <li>Security scan results</li>
    <li>Performance metrics</li>
  </ul>
</ProjectLayout>
